### {{ num.ehs }}.8 EHS Credits

- **Outside the monthly cap:** EHS Credits are never counted toward, or limited by, the monthly cap in Section {{ num.credits }}.
- **No earnback:** EHS Credits are never eligible for Earnback.
- **Repeat violations:** a second {{ sla.ehs.credits.repeat.class }} violation within {{ sla.ehs.credits.repeat.window_days }} days carries {{ sla.ehs.credits.repeat.multiplier }}× the EHS Credit.
- **Self-reporting and concealment:** {{ sla.ehs.credits.self_reporting }} (Reduction: {{ sla.ehs.credits.self_reported_reduction_pct }}%. Concealment multiplier: {{ sla.ehs.credits.concealment_multiplier }}×.)
- **Never based on reporting:** {{ sla.ehs.credits.never_based_on }}
- **Cost recovery:** {{ sla.ehs.credits.cost_recovery }}
- **Nature of EHS Credits:** {{ sla.ehs.credits.nature }}

